-- [openmls]: treemath panic-freedom — the 19 proof obligations (the audit surface).
-- One theorem per obligation, statements verbatim 1:1 with
-- `Openmls/Extraction/ProofObligationsExplicit.lean`. Also holds the loop specs/invariants
-- (loop machinery lives here by design), the validated companion specs (`level.spec_pure`,
-- `parent.spec_value`, `direct_path.spec_pure`), the `sibling.pre` discharge helpers, and the
-- raw `attribute [spec]` block. Hand-written; not regenerated by extraction.
import Aeneas
import CoreModels
import Openmls.Extraction.Types
import Openmls.Extraction.Funs
import Openmls.Extraction.Specs
import Openmls.Proofs.Common
import Openmls.Proofs.BitMath
